#: docs/zh/reference/profiles.md:8
msgid "编译档位与实例容量"
msgstr "Build profiles and instance capacities"

#: docs/zh/reference/profiles.md:10
msgid "profile 定义编译能力上限。应用在该范围内填写每个实例的容量。不支持的能力由配置校验拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"The profile sets the compiled capability ceiling. The application chooses each instance's capacities "
"within those limits. Validation rejects unsupported capabilities."

